# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LLM credentials for the Continum Copilot / AskData engine.
# Copy this file to ".env" (repo root) and fill in, OR use ".streamlit/secrets.toml".
# Real environment variables also work and take precedence.
#
# The app auto-selects the backend: OpenAI (default) or Azure OpenAI. Without a
# key the assistant still answers "about itself" from the README, but data
# questions require a key.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── OpenAI (default) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# ── Azure OpenAI (use instead of the above) ──────────────────────────────────
# OPENAI_API_TYPE=azure
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your-azure-openai-key
# OPENAI_API_BASE=https://your-resource.openai.azure.com/
# OPENAI_API_VERSION=2024-05-01-preview
# OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT_NAME=gpt-4o

# ── Optional: pick which bundled dataset the assistant queries ────────────────
# One of: sample (A/B experimentation campaign data, default) | shell
# ACTIVE_DATASET=sample
